Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.13,0:00:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.04,0:00:04.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Miss Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.79,0:00:08.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Asuna, this is my\Nguild, the Sleeping Knights!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.07,0:00:12.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name's Jun. What's up? How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.89,0:00:16.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, Miss Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.13,0:00:16.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.07,0:00:18.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.07,0:00:21.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really need to get a\Ngrip on those nerves, Tal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.97,0:00:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.99,0:00:26.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every time you meet a girl, you\Nturn into a blubbering mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.39,0:00:29.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, my name's Nori. Glad to meet ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.29,0:00:30.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Siyune.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.03,0:00:32.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's wonderful to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.55,0:00:34.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And thank you so much for coming today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.91,0:00:36.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.45,0:00:37.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name's Techi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.01,0:00:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.51,0:00:42.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Yuki, the leader of\Nthis guild, kinda sorta.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.89,0:00:44.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Asuna, don't laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.07,0:00:49.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But see, we want to be the only\Nguild to beat the boss on this floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.25,0:00:51.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we want you to help us! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.07,0:00:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
