Dialogue: 2,0:02:27.02,0:02:31.02,Title,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9\bord2.25\fs180\c&HE7EAC5&\3c&HE7EAC5&\ybord4.5\pos(960,765)}The Sleeping Knights
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.02,0:02:31.02,Title,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\bord6\fs180\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\alpha&H22&\pos(960,765)}The Sleeping Knights
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.19,0:02:35.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's very ambitious, but a boss raid\Nusually takes at least 49 players.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.11,0:02:38.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's seven parties with\Nseven players apiece.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.77,0:02:42.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So no matter how skilled you are with\Njust seven players, that's kind of...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.91,0:02:45.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, to be perfectly\Nhonest, it's unrealistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.63,0:02:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it sort of is, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.97,0:02:51.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We tried taking on the bosses\Non Floor 25 and 6 the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.89,0:02:53.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.80,0:02:54.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just you six?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.09,0:02:55.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.00,0:02:58.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you ask me, we put\Nup a pretty good fight, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.41,0:02:59.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But both times,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.19,0:03:04.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this huge guilt swooped in and beat him\Nbefore we could figure out our next move.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.97,0:03:06.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you even risk it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.21,0:03:09.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.12,0:03:11.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It goes back to when we met\Nin another GamesNet community.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.03,0:03:15.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We hit it off right away, and\Nwe've been friends ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.39,0:03:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we only have until next\Nspring to go on quests together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.11,0:03:23.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since our time's limited, we\Nwanted to make the most of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.01,0:03:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, come spring, we'll\Nall be busy with other things.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.41,0:03:31.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we decided that before\Nwe disbanded the guild,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.17,0:03:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we had to do something so amazing, so\Nunbelievable, we'd remember it forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.17,0:03:39.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's why you want to\Ndo this boss raid. Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.79,0:03:41.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we defeat a boss together,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.53,0:03:44.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our names will be inscribed\Non the Monument of Swordsmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.41,0:03:48.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, the one in the Town of\NBeginnings, in the Black Iron Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.79,0:03:52.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it sounds silly, and\Nmaybe even a little vain,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.49,0:03:56.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we really want to get our names\Nup on that wall, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.33,0:03:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But getting them on there's the hard part.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.41,0:04:02.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If a boss is defeated by a party,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.69,0:04:05.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then all of its members will get\Ntheir names inscribed on the monument.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.89,0:04:09.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if it's beaten by multiple\Nparties working in tandem,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.17,0:04:12.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,only the names of the party\Nleaders get inscribed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.37,0:04:14.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.55,0:04:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we want the names of everyone in\Nthe sleeping nights up on that wall,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.91,0:04:19.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we have to beat the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.85,0:04:21.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together, just us, no one else.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.43,0:04:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we talked it over\Nand came up with a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.57,0:04:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A party can have up to seven\Nplayers max. Therefore,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.51,0:04:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we decided to find someone as strong or\Neven stronger than our most powerful player,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.03,0:04:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.94,0:04:37.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and hope whoever we found\Naccepted our invitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.67,0:04:39.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.95,0:04:41.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why you were dueling.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.69,0:04:44.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you think\Nabout joining up with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.15,0:04:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't pay you very much, but\Nyou're welcome to what we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.63,0:04:50.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.31,0:04:54.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boss rates cost a fortune as it is,\Nso you should use your money for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.85,0:04:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd feel horrible taking\Nyour money, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.61,0:05:01.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want, you could give me whatever\Nthe boss drops and I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.17,0:05:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.08,0:05:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you'll join our party?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.23,0:05:23.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is nothing like\Nhow the old Aincrad was.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.43,0:05:29.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet, here I am thinking about\Nsafety margins and the odds of winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.69,0:05:34.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having safe fights and certain victories.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.83,0:05:36.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's more fun to games than that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.07,0:05:43.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet Yuuki and her\Nfriends already know this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.89,0:05:45.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better than I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.19,0:05:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's see how far we can go. Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.65,0:05:55.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the end, it's not about winning\Nor losing, it's having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.99,0:05:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch, Miss Asuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.21,0:06:02.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, I'd prefer it if\Nyou just called me Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.77,0:06:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you can call me Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.61,0:06:09.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That reminds me, Miss Yuki, sorry, Yuki,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.71,0:06:12.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the duel was all about\Ntesting players, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.17,0:06:13.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.61,0:06:18.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you must have gone up against a ton\Nof strong players before I showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.17,0:06:20.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you remember ever fighting\Na spriggan dressed in black?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.87,0:06:26.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he would have been using a\None-handed sword, huh, you know
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.15,0:06:32.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what I do man he was pretty tough\Nthen why didn't you ask him to
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.15,0:06:38.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,help you out I don't know he\Njust wasn't right well why not
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.25,0:06:41.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he found out my secret I can't
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.77,0:06:48.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have that okay so for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.43,0:06:49.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about we meet back here at 1?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.07,0:06:51.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.25,0:06:54.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And let's have fun. Great!
