Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.95,0:07:39.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.23,0:07:47.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last month, when you were late for dinner,\NI told you it better not happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.77,0:07:48.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.87,0:07:52.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're late because of that game,\Nso now you lose your privileges.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.71,0:07:54.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just lost track of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.73,0:07:56.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my fault, and I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.47,0:07:59.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you didn't have to go and\Npull the plug on me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.13,0:08:01.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could have shaken me\Nor even yelled in my ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.65,0:08:04.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would have gotten an alert in-game,\Nand then I could have logged out and…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.21,0:08:05.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tried that approach before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.81,0:08:08.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It took you five minutes to\Nsnap out of it, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.15,0:08:09.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.29,0:08:12.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had to say goodbye to\Neveryone before I logged in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.05,0:08:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't give me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.96,0:08:16.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you do in some stupid\Nvirtual game does not
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.87,0:08:20.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,take priority over your commitments\Nin the real world. Ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.93,0:08:24.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.35,0:08:28.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be more careful next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.95,0:08:31.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This will be your last warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.33,0:08:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you break your word to me because of\Nthat thing again, I'm confiscating it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.01,0:08:40.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what's going\Non in that head of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.29,0:08:43.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You lost two years of\Nyour life because of that…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.11,0:08:45.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That infernal machine,\Nyou could have died.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.13,0:08:48.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you even stand to look at it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.23,0:08:52.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't the nerve gear, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.23,0:08:59.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's dinner time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.97,0:09:01.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get changed and come downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.33,0:09:04.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.37,0:09:06.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.01,0:09:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
