Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.49,0:10:12.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ORGAN PLAYS
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.79,0:10:25.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a good lineup, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.15,0:10:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.05,0:10:32.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Yuki, Jun,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.65,0:10:36.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and Tachi are up front, then\NTolkien and Nori are mid-range,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.73,0:10:39.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Asuna are the backup? Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.45,0:10:43.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I guess, if you're covered, maybe\NI should hang back as the rear guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.69,0:10:44.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.21,0:10:48.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel bad you're not up front\Nwhen you're so good with a sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.09,0:10:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't mind at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.59,0:10:51.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I'm not much good as a tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.87,0:10:52.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.93,0:10:57.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm curious to see whether June and\NTetchy can survive a proper beatdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.07,0:10:59.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.37,0:11:00.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.83,0:11:01.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess we'll try.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.49,0:11:03.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.97,0:11:09.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, ready to go take a\Npeek at that boss room? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.73,0:11:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.77,0:11:21.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.03,0:11:25.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.43,0:11:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if they really need me after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.15,0:11:33.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe how quickly you\Nguys are clearing the labyrinth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.81,0:11:35.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're an amazing group of players.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.59,0:11:40.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the boss room!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.75,0:11:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.37,0:11:45.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuki, hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.13,0:12:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.25,0:12:20.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.43,0:12:21.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hang on, hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.47,0:12:22.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not here to fight you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.55,0:12:24.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then lower your weapons, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.21,0:12:25.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get rid of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.95,0:12:28.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep your eye on them, and if they\Nmake a move for their weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.05,0:12:31.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hit them with an Aquabine\Nspell. You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.09,0:12:35.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is our first ever PvP in Halo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.81,0:12:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's kind of thrilling.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.07,0:12:42.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're not PKers, then\Nwhy were you hiding from us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.77,0:12:44.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were waiting for someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.39,0:12:45.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were hiding because we didn't want to
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.05,0:12:47.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get hit by a mob before\Nour friends got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.99,0:12:49.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.71,0:12:51.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.57,0:12:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're here to take on the boss, so\Nif you're not ready to enter yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.73,0:12:57.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd like to take a crack at it first!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.77,0:13:00.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.49,0:13:08.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll just hang here, you\Nknow, till our buddies show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.01,0:13:11.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh and uh, watch your backs in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.27,0:13:12.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.69,0:13:19.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give those dudes a second thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.59,0:13:20.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.81,0:13:25.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, let's just stick to the\Nplan and have a look inside, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.89,0:13:26.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.63,0:13:31.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead of just scoping it out, let's\Nbust in there and trash the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.67,0:13:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to try, go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.93,0:13:38.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just make sure not to use any of your\Nexpensive potions and stuff to recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.45,0:13:41.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Siune and I will support you with\Nhealing spells, so fight hard,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.37,0:13:43.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but try not to get too far in the red.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.83,0:13:44.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right on, coach!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.63,0:13:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.57,0:13:49.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you die, don't respawn right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.77,0:13:52.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just hang out and study\Nthe boss's attack patterns.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.19,0:13:56.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then let's meet back at the Lombard save\Npoint and talk about what we learned, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.79,0:13:57.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roger that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.33,0:14:47.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get him! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.69,0:14:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.65,0:14:56.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got our butts kicked!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.09,0:14:57.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of attack was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.71,0:14:59.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's gotta be against the rules!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.81,0:15:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That boss sure knows how to defend itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.37,0:15:03.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think that's a random move?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.75,0:15:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Using his arms to block?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.21,0:15:08.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we fought so hard, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.09,0:15:10.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.11,0:15:12.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come here, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.47,0:15:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gather round.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.23,0:15:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.14,0:15:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you're tired, but we need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.59,0:15:21.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember those three guys\Nstanding by the boss room?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.23,0:15:22.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.69,0:15:26.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were scouts from a guild\Nthat specializes in boss raids.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.09,0:15:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.11,0:15:31.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If another guild tries to hit that boss\Nroom, their job is to sit back and watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.97,0:15:35.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bosses you tried to raid on the\Nprevious floor and the one before that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.07,0:15:38.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling they were there, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.29,0:15:40.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had no idea they were even there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.87,0:15:44.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They didn't get in our way or try to\Nstop us, so they're definitely spies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.81,0:15:46.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All they want is intel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.09,0:15:50.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when a small guild like the Sleeping\NKnights comes along to take on a boss,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.11,0:15:54.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're helping them figure out all\Nits attack patterns and weaknesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.87,0:15:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.91,0:15:59.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The door shut behind us when we were inside,\Nand they definitely didn't follow us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.81,0:16:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, if they can't see\Nus fighting the boss,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.49,0:16:05.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how are they going to\Ngather any intel on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.33,0:16:07.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, they could see us fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.71,0:16:11.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Towards the end there, I looked over and\NI saw a tiny gray lizard near June's feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.83,0:16:14.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's when I realized I\Nlet my guard down too soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.03,0:16:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a dark spell called peeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.89,0:16:20.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It binds a familiar to a player\Nand the caster sees what it sees.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.09,0:16:24.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what you're saying is,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.17,0:16:29.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,after we got hammered by the\Nbosses on floors 25 and 6,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.69,0:16:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that other guild swooping in and\Nbeating them, that wasn't a coincidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.03,0:16:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm afraid it wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.63,0:16:38.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You probably fought so\Nhard the boss used every
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.15,0:16:40.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,move it had against you\Nand they saw it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.61,0:16:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how they beat\Nthe bosses so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.33,0:16:45.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They used us again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.83,0:16:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now they know everything\Nabout this boss, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.27,0:16:51.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're probably in there taking it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.31,0:16:56.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those dicks. Damn it. Easy, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.63,0:16:59.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't count us out just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.57,0:17:02.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what can we do about it now? Simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.09,0:17:05.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's 2:30 p.m. in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.55,0:17:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this time of day and\Non such short notice,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.17,0:17:11.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it'll be hard to find enough\Npeople for a raid party.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.13,0:17:14.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By my estimate, it should\Ntake them at least an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.51,0:17:16.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's plenty of time for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.01,0:17:18.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So here's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.53,0:17:22.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After this, if we can get back to that\Nroom in 30 minutes, we can take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.53,0:17:23.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.85,0:17:28.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.59,0:17:35.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last one there's a rotten egg!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.63,0:17:38.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.41,0:17:39.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slow bump!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.15,0:17:45.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.06,0:17:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.01,0:17:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.09,0:17:54.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They won't advance with only 20 players.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.29,0:17:57.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should have enough time to give it\None more try before the rest show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.79,0:17:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.57,0:18:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.19,0:18:03.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd like to try the boss before you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.59,0:18:05.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you guys let us by?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.41,0:18:07.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Dollface.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.71,0:18:09.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The boss room's off-limits for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.97,0:18:11.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, off-limits?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.55,0:18:13.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.27,0:18:16.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It means in a couple minutes, the rest\Nof the guild's gonna roll up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.81,0:18:19.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're just holding the room till they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.19,0:18:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want, you can wait over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.21,0:18:23.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And how long do you expect us to wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.61,0:18:26.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, another hour or so?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.05,0:18:29.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we don't have that kind of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.35,0:18:31.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you were going in right now,\Nwell, that's a different story.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.05,0:18:34.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you're not, so let us go in first.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.05,0:18:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I don't make the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.85,0:18:40.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just a grunt here, following\Norders like everyone else, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.93,0:18:42.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you got a complaint?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.05,0:18:44.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go to the guild headquarters\Nand talk to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.01,0:18:47.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's over in Ygg City,\Nso get—Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.09,0:18:48.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's far away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.09,0:18:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'd take us at least\Nan hour to get there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.77,0:18:52.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, big guy. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.35,0:18:55.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just trying to figure things out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.27,0:18:59.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, no matter how nice we ask,\Nyou're not gonna let us get by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.09,0:19:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what you're saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.21,0:19:02.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.73,0:19:04.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's pretty much what I'm saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.19,0:19:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, if that's what you're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.63,0:19:08.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wanna fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.41,0:19:16.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Yuki, are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.69,0:19:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna, sometimes you gotta\Nfight to get your point across.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.65,0:19:25.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, like how dead serious\Nyou are about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.85,0:19:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.35,0:19:29.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, that's pretty much how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.85,0:19:31.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.43,0:19:34.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These folks know exactly\Nwhat I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.07,0:19:36.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They look like the serious types.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.55,0:19:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could chop away all day, and they'd\Ndefend this room to the last player.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.49,0:19:43.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, pig guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.75,0:19:46.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got orders to...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.81,0:19:52.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, draw your sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.03,0:20:16.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You little punk, I'm gonna\Nmake you pay for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.17,0:20:27.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sometimes you gotta fight\Nto get your point across.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.29,0:20:34.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.25,0:21:02.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.55,0:21:09.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have dealt with\Nthis when I had the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.37,0:21:10.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.93,0:21:13.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My big mouth got you into this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.57,0:21:15.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it was totally worth it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.47,0:21:17.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.57,0:21:21.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because just now, I saw the best\Nsmile I've ever seen on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.15,0:21:25.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll\Nstart pulling my weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.47,0:21:28.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We might not take down this boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.27,0:21:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the next one, I\Npromise, that one's ours!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.55,0:21:38.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some folks just don't know when to quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.31,0:21:52.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.67,0:22:00.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stand down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.15,0:22:03.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not getting past me.
