Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.52,0:23:26.69,ED-En,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}You made it ring out very, very loudly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.91,0:23:33.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to see you.
